DEEPS KASKAD Android client
===========================

This application is a fork of AmneziaWG for Android
(https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amneziawg-android), which in turn is a fork of the
official WireGuard for Android client (https://github.com/WireGuard/wireguard-android).
The upstream projects are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; this fork
keeps that license, see LICENSE and COPYING.

Source code of this fork, as distributed in every APK we publish:
https://github.com/lange232/deeps-kaskad-awg

Changes made for deeps kaskad
-----------------------------

The following parts differ from upstream amneziawg-android; files that were edited
carry a "Modified for deeps kaskad" notice in their header.

* Application identity: id `ru.deffhost.kaskad`, name "DEEPS KASKAD", our icons,
  wordmark, dark palette, version scheme.
* deeps kaskad panel support (`org.amnezia.awg.panel`, `PanelActivity`,
  `PanelRoutingActivity`, `PanelStatsActivity`): sign-in, account configurations,
  internet exits and subnets per configuration, traffic statistics, QR and text
  sharing, `device_id` handling.
* Split tunneling per tunnel (`org.amnezia.awg.split.SplitTunnelActivity`); the
  upstream "applications" picker of the tunnel editor was removed.
* Drag-to-reorder on the tunnel list, persisted tunnel order.
* Brand styling of the system bars and the toolbar title.
* Panel-specific strings, and the import disclaimer that pointed at amnezia.org.

